  "description": "REPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES We wanted to evoke the great bikes of the past using materials very similar to those of their day, but technologically advanced. The Legendaria frame, as well as the fork, is made entirely by hand in Italy by skilled craftsmen with great experience, even using the same methods of the past for welding and cutting the pipes. These are strictly made of triple-butted Columbus Spirit steel, while the rear is made with double-butted Cromor tubes assembled in an extraordinary way with special junctions. The fork is also assembled with a special brazed precision-cast head. The measurements for this splendid vintage-style piece are traditional from 47 to 64. Both the BSA type bottom bracket and the fork head are pantographed to imprint and make the brand of this wonderful frame indelible. IDEAL FOR Perfect for road routes to be covered in complete comfort, ideal for randonnées and ultracycling events. PERFECT FOR YOU IF A road bike for lovers of vintage and the great glories of the past, who are looking for a road bike with a unique style and extraordinary rideability.",
